{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國百事可樂回收部分批次能量飲品佳得樂，總數約有12萬箱，原因是未有標示食用色素。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國食品及藥物管理局發通告指，百事可樂上月25日起在美國其中37個州，包括加州、紐約州和佛羅里達州等，自願收回旗下佳得樂部分產品，包括檸檬青檸味、橙味的28盎司無糖及普通版，相關批次有效日期分別為明年4至6月。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.RECALL-0700_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yuVEriHBOs1791245201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.RECALL-0700_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.RECALL-0700_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ueImcrngRb1791245199.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.RECALL-0700_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.RECALL-0700.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Z9TCplIBkH1791245194.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.RECALL-0700.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當局指相關產品含有未經申報的黃色6號及5號人工色素，佳得樂未有在標籤列出。至於購買相關產品的顧客，佳得樂暫時未有公布退款安排。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T00:39:36.495842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}